    "name": "Dummy Dungeon",
    "steam_appid": 1891030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.webm?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.mp4?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dummy Dungeon, despite its colorful visuals, offers fast-paced gameplay from a first-person view that requires the player's mechanical skills and concentration, and in addition, gives the player a great deal of freedom to create his unique playstyle as the player makes it through the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various locations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different corners of the world; from dark dungeons to huge flying machines, all filled with unique enemies and tons of items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 23 playable characters. Use a grappling hook as a Monk or produce powerful enhancements in a cauldron as a Witch. The effects offered by a character drastically affect dungeon combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/ff026e951e300385ec3a714f169d78f8.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/ff026e951e300385ec3a714f169d78f8.webp?t=1750791543\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful perks and upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your stats and weapons as you go, customize your equipment according to your own vision to save the beautiful princess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each perk can be upgraded with additional copies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/87a3a2227560ffcdaf5604fda82dbd41.avif?t=1750791543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Large arsenal of unique weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge number of weapons with unique enhancements. Weapon effects vary greatly from a simple critical hit or fire enhancement to effects that completely change the effect of the weapon such as knockup, creating zones, flying behind the player, gaining gold, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.webm?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.mp4?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging fights and interesting bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor ends with a battle against a powerful opponent with multiple attacks and abilities, making the fights very dynamic.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.webm?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/037f1123c3d8ad1f88d1d8fc07638955.mp4?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dummy Dungeon, despite its colorful visuals, offers fast-paced gameplay from a first-person view that requires the player's mechanical skills and concentration, and in addition, gives the player a great deal of freedom to create his unique playstyle as the player makes it through the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various locations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different corners of the world; from dark dungeons to huge flying machines, all filled with unique enemies and tons of items to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 23 playable characters. Use a grappling hook as a Monk or produce powerful enhancements in a cauldron as a Witch. The effects offered by a character drastically affect dungeon combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/ff026e951e300385ec3a714f169d78f8.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/ff026e951e300385ec3a714f169d78f8.webp?t=1750791543\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerful perks and upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your stats and weapons as you go, customize your equipment according to your own vision to save the beautiful princess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each perk can be upgraded with additional copies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/87a3a2227560ffcdaf5604fda82dbd41.avif?t=1750791543\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Large arsenal of unique weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge number of weapons with unique enhancements. Weapon effects vary greatly from a simple critical hit or fire enhancement to effects that completely change the effect of the weapon such as knockup, creating zones, flying behind the player, gaining gold, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.poster.avif?t=1750791543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.webm?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891030/extras/54f1b09fcb9b03ce56b199661bef7cee.mp4?t=1750791543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging fights and interesting bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor ends with a battle against a powerful opponent with multiple attacks and abilities, making the fights very dynamic.</p>",
